3
00:00:27.067 --> 00:00:29.098
Minnie: No work today.

4
00:00:29.099 --> 00:00:46.351
The field is too muddy.

5
00:00:46.352 --> 00:00:48.881
We'll stay inside today. We

6
00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:53.652
can all get some extra sleep. Elvin: I

7
00:00:53.653 --> 00:00:55.691
really like sleeping. I'm glad

8
00:00:55.692 --> 00:00:58.837
it's rainy today. Gary: I'm not.

9
00:00:58.838 --> 00:01:04.968
I like working. Minnie: No

10
00:01:04.969 --> 00:01:14.409
more work until the rain stops. Elvin: I

11
00:01:14.410 --> 00:01:20.649
hope it's rainy all day. Gary: I

12
00:01:20.650 --> 00:01:25.619
hope it's sunny soon. Elvin: I'm

13
00:01:25.620 --> 00:01:29.574
going back to bed. Yippee! Gary: Shh!

14
00:01:29.575 --> 00:02:00.440
Don't be so noisy! Minnie:

15
00:02:00.441 --> 00:02:10.126
Where are you two going? Jack:

16
00:02:10.127 --> 00:02:12.256
We're going to the old barn. Polly:

17
00:02:12.257 --> 00:02:16.508
Yeah. We want to clean. Minnie:

18
00:02:16.509 --> 00:02:19.701
It's too rainy. Stay here today. Polly:

19
00:02:19.702 --> 00:02:23.046
NO! Minnie:

20
00:02:23.047 --> 00:02:26.360
Excuse me? Jack:

21
00:02:26.361 --> 00:02:29.436
She means, "No, thank you."

22
00:02:29.437 --> 00:02:31.538
Polly: Right. We want to see Om—

23
00:02:31.539 --> 00:02:36.656
I mean, we want to clean. Minnie:

24
00:02:36.657 --> 00:02:41.330
You two like cleaning a lot. Jack:

25
00:02:41.331 --> 00:02:44.235
We really like cleaning! Polly:

26
00:02:44.236 --> 00:02:53.313
So, can we go? Please!

27
00:02:53.314 --> 00:02:58.699
Minnie: I guess so. Watch out for puddles.

28
00:02:58.700 --> 00:03:02.159
Polly: Yay! Thanks, Minnie!

29
00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:10.475
Minnie: Have fun.

